{"about_the_game":"<strong>Let It Go</strong> is a fast-paced puzzle game that will reveal philozofic' secrets of the Great Meow-Meow.<br><br>Play as a tormented soul on a deserted island, and solve the puzzles to find out what is preventing you from living your dream. But beware, the Great Meow-Meow offers you only 21 seconds on his island! Fortunately there are ways to increase your game time...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370770/extras/0a3207ddc7a3c51f46f13ba48a66112e.webp?t=1606923683\" width=612 height=18 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is the secret to go live your dreams?</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370770/extras/f00de50ff8f3e09930bd5dc82120f144.avif?t=1606923683\" width=616 height=264 /></span><br>A playful experience of personal development, with a real treasure revealed, at least to those who will be able to pass the tests?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time belongs to you</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370770/extras/7525a722cc272a5b09219309947ebe8a.poster.avif?t=1606923683\" width=692 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370770/extras/7525a722cc272a5b09219309947ebe8a.webm?t=1606923683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370770/extras/7525a722cc272a5b09219309947ebe8a.mp4?t=1606923683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>An extraordinary power that will allow you to play with the events of the island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make offerings to the Great Meow-Meow</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370770/extras/eb7c55551fdaf90bf7206bfb93a80ff8.avif?t=1606923683\" width=616 height=264 /></span><br>There are bottles of heavenly milk hidden on the island... find them, and the Great Meow-Meow will reward you with more time to explore his island and solve the riddles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370770/extras/0a3207ddc7a3c51f46f13ba48a66112e.webp?t=1606923683\" width=612 height=18 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A short life span</h2>Your time is precious, that's why Let It Go is a short and deep experience <i>(1-2 hour of play on average for a first game.)</i> We want a majority of players to be able to finish Let It Go and get the secret to go live their dreams.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speedrun mode</h2>Let It Go is a game where you will learn how the island works by heart. After completing the game, you will unlock a speedrun mode with a brand new soundtrack, with no possibility to return to the Great Meow-Meow's Hub.<br><br><br>Live <strong>a philosophical experience approved by the Great Meow-Meow,</strong> he knows what is good glory to him !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370770/extras/078c61c754ee956928f76effb569d566.avif?t=1606923683\" width=612 height=317 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f30d76d52c6f15689669d6cf6b8e6227adff1585.jpg","localized_name":"3 BOTTLE","name":"3 BOTTLE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1370770/f30d76d52c6f15689669d6cf6b8e6227adff1585.jpg"},{"icon":"2bea75d62a41fa0eb2bf056fdc1fd15a3d649c11.jpg","localized_name":"FLYING UMBRELLA","name":"FLYING UMBRELLA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1370770/2bea75d62a41fa0eb2bf056fdc1fd15a3d649c11.jpg"},{"icon":"b6578cb574cb7e6d6f1536928e02dd93e7a7932b.jpg","localized_name":"COOKING","name":"COOKING","path":"h